        {
          "text": "window",
          "pos": "noun",
          "role": "宾语",
          "group": "cl"
        }
      ],
      "distractors": [
        {
          "text": "which",
          "pos": "pronoun",
          "role": "关系词",
          "group": "cl"
        }
      ],
      "explain": "强调句的公式：It is/was + 被强调的部分 + that/who + 其余部分。强调人的时候用 who 或 that，强调物的时候只能用 that。",
      "example": "It was Tom who broke the window. / Tom broke the window.",
      "win": "要强调谁，就把它夹在 It was 和 who 中间。"
    },
    {
