          "text": "I",
          "pos": "pronoun",
          "role": "主语",
          "group": "cl"
        },
        {
          "text": "love",
          "pos": "verb",
          "role": "谓语",
          "group": "cl"
        }
      ],
      "distractors": [
        {
          "text": "what",
          "pos": "pronoun",
          "role": "关系词",
          "group": "cl"
        }
      ],
      "explain": "强调句的连接词是 that（强调人时也可以用 who），但绝不能用 what。what 是用来引导名词性从句的，它不能当强调句的连接词。",
      "example": "It is you that I love. / I love you.",
      "win": "强调句用 that 或 who，不用 what。"
    },
